<title>USA: Caliber System names Louis Valerio CFO.</title>
<headline>Caliber System names Louis Valerio CFO.</headline>
<dateline>AKRON, Ohio 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Caliber System Inc said on Monday that Louis J. Valerio has been elected senior vice president-finance and chief financial officer.</p>
<p>The position had been open since July.</p>
<p>Mr. Valerio, 47, was the Corporate Controller at Westinghouse Corporation, Pittsburgh, with responsibility for corporate reengineering, global sourcing and logistics, and mergers and acquisitions, a statement from Caliber said.</p>
</text>
